{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534070/extras/Exorsys-windows-promo.gif?t=1744150376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to exorSYS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After unknowingly upgrading to a cursed operating system, you must follow a breadcrumb of previous victims in order to uncover the truth before you inevitably become a victim yourself. Solve puzzles, dig for secrets, hack computers, and use  special programs to help advance from level to level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">exorSYS Report Panel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534070/extras/demo-vanished.gif?t=1744150376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Something </i>is trying to keep you out. Use the included <u><strong>exorSYS Report Panel</strong></u> when connecting to hacking into another computer to report anything strange. Pay close attention to your environment for anything out of the ordinary. It can be something simple like a displaced or missing object. Sometimes it's far worse. Stave off suspicious activity long enough to successfully complete the hack.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Object Moved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Object Missing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extra Object</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_strike\">Pazuzu</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Object Changed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And other <i>strange</i> occurrences</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Desktop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534070/extras/desktop_image.png?t=1744150376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the included programs to access new information. You have a variety of interesting applications at your disposal. Any new information acquired from levels will appear on your desktop for you to view and interact with including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Emails</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ciphers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And many more puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pay close attention</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you are decoding a clue on your desktop or looking for missing objects in a museum, pay close attention to your surroundings and dig deep. <i>Anything</i> could be a clue, so don't be so quick to rule anything out. Even this page that your reading <i>right now</i> could be a clue. Maybe in the pictures?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534070?t=1744150376","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534070?t=1744150376","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534070/67c73707c78f0a0f0be413fd7e92290ac1e3a9c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744150376","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534070/67c73707c78f0a0f0be413fd7e92290ac1e3a9c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744150376","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534070/extras/Exorsys-windows-promo.gif?t=1744150376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to exorSYS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After unknowingly upgrading to a cu